74:
Server NFS operativo\n
La connessione al server NFS\n
'%s' e' operativa.\n
Tutti i dispositivi remoti accessibili\n
tramite server sono ora disponibili.\n
\t\n

75:
Server NFS non operativo\n
La connessione al server NFS\n
'%s' e' persa.\n
Tutti i dispositivi collegati tramite\n
server non sono più disponibili.\n
\t\n

80:
Il task in background %s\n
ha una versione piu' vecchia di un\n
modulo installato rispetto al sorgente\n
%s\n
\t\n
Riavviare il sistema con un P-START\n
per installare la versione piu' recente
81:
Il task in background %s\n
non e' riuscito a caricare una versione\n
piu' aggiornata del modulo.\n
TLa sorgente del modulo e' %s\n
\t\n
Vedere messaggi precedenti per la causa\n
o riavviare il sistema con un P-START\n
per caricare la nuova versione.
82:
RAPID Task supervision\n
Task %s is not running\n
the system will be set in SysFail\n
state. It's now impossible to change\n
to motors on\n
%s\n
\t\n
See previous messages for the cause\n
Restart the system to reset the\n
error state
83:
RAPID Task supervision\n
Task %s is not running\n
the system will be set in motors off\n
state.\n
%s\n
\t\n
See previous messages for the cause\n
 
84:
RAPID Task supervision\n
Task %s is not running\n
the main task will also stop\n
%s\n
\t\n
See previous messages for the cause\n

88:
Restart not possible\n
Restart is not possible from the\n
current program position.\n
The Program Pointer must be moved\n
before restart.\n
\t\n
Reason:\n
The system has been in system\n
failure state  or\n
the program execution is blocked.\n
 
89:
A P-Start is ordered\n
%s\n
\t\n

8901:
The P-Start has been ordered from\n
the system.
8902:
The P-Start has been ordered manually or\n
automatically during a configuration.
8903:
The P-Start has been ordered from\n
I/O unit.
90:
P-Start done\n
An ordered P-Start is done.\n
All tasks are reset\n
and all user programs are lost.\n
\t\n

91:
(Re)start not possible\n
(Re)start is not possible due to lost\n
contact with IO module\n
%s configured with\n
trustlevel 3.\n
\t\n

